  "ruleText": "Fam 401.01 “Gross incompetence” means repeated or pervasive behavior that demonstrates a certified family mediator is unable to practice in accordance with RSA 328-C or Fam 400-800.\n\nSource. #9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRES: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12635, eff 10-2-18",
